><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rent-seeking</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9341em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6124em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2958em;vertical-align:-1.6124em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.3876em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">执行漏损（净损失）</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.0659em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">leakage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9341em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6124em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>租金转移本身不减少社会总产出（只是再分配），真正减少产出的是争夺租金的成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rent-seeking</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{rent-seeking}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rent-seeking</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与执行漏损 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>leakage</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{leakage}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">leakage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。只看「补贴了多少」的评估，等于把再分配当成绩效。</p>\n<p>俘获有两种形式。<strong>物质俘获</strong>包括贿赂、竞选献金、旋转门。2019 年 Brezis 与 Cariolle 对金融业旋转门的研究发现，前五大金融机构占了约 80% 的旋转门流动，说明俘获集中在少数巨头而非整个行业。<strong>认知俘获</strong>（cultural capture）更隐蔽：技术性强的领域里监管机构必须从产业界招募专家，监管者对「合理做法」的默认判断因此被行业内化。日本的<strong>天下り</strong>（amakudari，退休官僚空降企业）被视为核电监管失灵的一个深层原因。</p>\n<p>系统化的俘获即<strong>国家俘获</strong>。南非的估算提供量级参考：前财政部长戈尔丹（Pravin Gordhan）估计国家俘获造成约 2500 亿兰特损失；这些数字远大于单笔腐败金额，因为它们衡量的是<strong>规则被扭曲后的全经济效率损失</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"执行偏差的可观测信号与度量\">执行偏差的可观测信号与度量</h2><p>要防住偏差，先要能看见它。宏观治理指标是起点：世界银行的**国家政策与制度评估（CPIA）**自 1977 年起用 1–6 分评估包括公共部门管理、预算与税收动员在内的 16 项；<strong>世界治理指标（WGI）<strong>的「政府效能」「监管质量」维度综合企业调查与专家评估；2024 年起世界银行以 <strong>B-READY</strong> 取代停更的《营商环境报告》；透明国际的</strong>腐败感知指数（CPI）<strong>提供跨国横截面。但这些指标的弱点在上一篇《国家能力与产业治理架构》中已点明：<strong>国家能力在部门之间极不均衡</strong>，一个能高效征收增值税的财政系统未必能判断一家晶圆厂的产能爬坡是否达标。因此防控必须落到</strong>项目级信号</strong>上。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>绿色信号（偏差低）</th>\n<th>红色信号（偏差高）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>资格设定</td>\n<td>标准公开、可量化、对在位者与新人一视同仁</td>\n<td>标准含「技术路线由主管部门认定」等自由裁量条款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分配决策</td>\n<td>评审记录与打分明细可查、异议可申</td>\n<td>评审不公开、周期极短、中标方集中于老关系户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资金使用</td>\n<td>用途受限、分期拨付与里程碑挂钩</td>\n<td>一次性拨付、用途宽泛、可替代自有支出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产出验收</td>\n<td>独立第三方核验、指标可被外部复算</td>\n<td>自行申报、指标口径频变、验收前后定义不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退出机制</td>\n<td>未达标可追回、有实际追回案例</td>\n<td>追回条款从未执行、失败项目续期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>可操作的量化指标是<strong>补贴漏损率</strong>，即名义投入与实际形成有效产出之间的差额比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>Y</mi><mtext>actual</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>nominal</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mtext>sector</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = 1 - \\frac{\\Delta Y_{\\text{actual}}}{\\Delta S_{\\text{nominal}}\\cdot \\eta_{\\text{sector}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">nominal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sector</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">actual</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mtext>sector</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_{\\text{sector}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sector</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该部门在无俘获基准下的转化系数。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 持续偏高而无人追责，本身就是偏差的制度性信号——问题往往不在数值，而在于<strong>没有人因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 高而被问责</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"制度防线的设计-从可撤销承诺到穿透披露\">制度防线的设计：从可撤销承诺到穿透披露</h2><p>防线是分层部署的，且必须假设每一层都会被试探。第一层是<strong>承诺的可撤销性</strong>：资金与里程碑绑定、未达标可停可追。美国《芯片与科学法案》（CHIPS and Science Act，2022 年 8 月 9 日签署）为半导体拨款 527 亿美元；其 2023 年 2 月 28 日发布的首份申请通知鼓励签署项目劳工协议、限制股票回购，并安排「<strong>与联邦政府分享超额利润</strong>」；同年 9 月商务部敲定规则，禁止受助者在「受关注国家」将先进制程产能扩张超过 5%、成熟制程超过 10%。但<strong>追回（clawback）在法案中并未形成最终化公式</strong>——2022 年 10 月与 2023 年 2 月议员两次要求商务部说明将如何「追回被滥用的资金」，说明「可撤销承诺」在立法层面常只是宣示，执行力取决于行政细则与政治意愿。</p>\n<p>第二层是<strong>穿透式透明度</strong>。实际控制人披露是识别关联交易与空壳投标的基础设施。欧盟《外国补贴条例》（FSR，Regulation (EU) 2022/2560）自 <strong>2023 年 7 月 13 日</strong>起适用，允许欧盟委员会对并购与公共采购中的扭曲性外国补贴开展调查，并可直接发起<strong>依职权调查</strong>，把补贴透明度扩展为跨境工具。</p>\n<p>第三层是<strong>外部监督与激励相容的举报机制</strong>。美国《虚假申报法》（False Claims Act）允许举报人以「<strong>qui tam</strong>」方式代表政府起诉欺诈者并分享追回款，把内部人掌握的信息转化为监督资源。英国《2010 年反贿赂法》第 7 条创设「<strong>未能预防贿赂</strong>」罪，自 <strong>2011 年 7 月 1 日</strong>生效，对在英国有业务的商业组织施加严格责任，唯一抗辩是证明已维持「<strong>充分程序</strong>」。美国《反海外腐败法》（FCPA，1977 年 12 月 19 日签署）的执行强度本身已成政治变量——<strong>2025 年 2 月 10 日</strong>第 14209 号行政令曾指示司法部暂停执法，该暂停又在 <strong>2025 年 6 月</strong>被解除。<strong>反腐执法的确定性本身就需要被设计保护</strong>。</p>\n<p>第四层最关键：<strong>把规则的生成过程与利益相关方隔离</strong>——决策分散到多个机构、评审人员轮换、离职后设冷却期。前三层都假设规则本身公正，而俘获恰恰发生在这个前提之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2025-2026-年的新变量\">2025–2026 年的新变量</h2><p><strong>产业政策在数量上激增。</strong> 据 Global Trade Alert 的月度汇总，仅 2026 年 8 月一个月就记录了 <strong>945 项</strong>贸易与产业政策动向，美国、中国、欧盟是主要来源。当干预措施以每月近千项的速度增长时，<strong>用于监督的行政资源不可能同比例增长</strong>，单位政策的审查强度必然被稀释。</p>\n<p><strong>工具从补贴转向国家持股。</strong> 2025 年 8 月，美国政府以约 <strong>88.7 亿美元</strong>取得英特尔约 <strong>9.9%</strong> 的股权（每股 20.47 美元），结构上被描述为无董事会席位与治理权的被动持股。这把「补贴的追回问题」变成了「<strong>股权的治理与退出问题</strong>」：国家既是出资者又是监管者，原有针对补贴的透明度与追回框架不能直接覆盖这类利益冲突。</p>\n<p><strong>反腐执法的确定性下降。</strong> FCPA 在 2025 年经历「暂停—恢复」，表明跨境反腐的执行强度会随政治周期摆动。企业因此<strong>不能把合规底线建立在某一届政府的执法热情上</strong>；政策设计者则应把护栏写入法律而非行政指引。</p>\n<p><strong>平台化监管带来新的俘获入口。</strong> 当补贴申请与资质认定越来越多通过线上平台完成时，<strong>数据接口与算法规则</strong>成为新的可被影响对象——谁定义「合格」的数据口径、谁维护企业名录，谁就在分配租金。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>执行链条上的损耗分三类：<strong>行政执行偏差</strong>（目标被稀释）、<strong>利益集团俘获</strong>（规则被定制）、<strong>腐败与欺诈</strong>（资金被套取）。俘获常常是<strong>合法</strong>的，加严刑罚防不住它。</li>\n<li>收益集中、成本分散的不对称是俘获的生成机制；租金转移本身不是净损失，<strong>争夺成本与执行漏损</strong>才是。</li>\n<li>度量必须从宏观排名下沉到<strong>项目级信号</strong>：资格标准是否可量化、评审是否可复现、拨付是否与里程碑挂钩、追回条款是否有真实执行案例。「条款存在但从不执行」是最常见的形式化防线。</li>\n<li>制度防线应分层：承诺可撤销 → 穿透式透明度 → 外部监督与举报人激励 → <strong>规则生成过程的隔离</strong>。</li>\n<li>值得跟踪的三个变量：干预措施数量激增稀释审查强度；工具从补贴转向<strong>国家持股</strong>引入新的利益冲突；<strong>反腐执法的政治化</strong>说明确定性本身需要被立法保护。</li>\n<li>与同章《<a href=\"policy-instruments-incentive-design\">政策工具与激励设计</a>》配合阅读：那一篇讲工具与激励设计，本篇讲工具落到企业之前的漏损；执行载体的组织选择见《<a href=\"state-capacity-industrial-governance\">国家能力与产业治理架构</a>》。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"执行偏差、利益集团俘获与腐败风险防控","id":"执行偏差-利益集团俘获与腐败风险防控"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从租金到俘获：政治经济学的机制","id":"从租金到俘获-政治经济学的机制"},{"level":2,"text":"执行偏差的可观测信号与度量","id":"执行偏差的可观测信号与度量"},{"level":2,"text":"制度防线的设计：从可撤销承诺到穿透披露","id":"制度防线的设计-从可撤销承诺到穿透披露"},{"level":2,"text":"2025–2026 年的新变量","id":"2025-2026-年的新变量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"政策工具与激励设计：补贴、定向信贷、税收与政府采购","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/industrial-policy-strategic-trade-pe/implementation-state-capacity/policy-instruments-incentive-design"},"next":{"title":"产业政策效果的计量评估：DID、事件研究与结构模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/industrial-policy-strategic-trade-pe/evaluation-global-governance/policy-evaluation-methods"}}